    {
      "id": "f-8d2b45f1",
      "title": "Unbounded process-global session cache",
      "severity": "P2",
      "category": "performance",
      "confidence": "medium",
      "status": "open",
      "details": "The cache has no size bound and no eviction. Each distinct token prefix adds an entry that is never removed, so memory grows with the number of distinct sessions the process has seen. Independent of the P0 above: fixing the key would leave this unbounded.",
